                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nao wakahesabiwa Walawi wenye miaka thelathini na zaidi; na jumla yao kwa vichwa, mtu kwa mtu, ikawa elfu thelathini na nane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
