        },
        {
          "text": " Basi Daudi akawagawanya kwa zamu zao sawasawa na wana wa Lawi; Gershoni, Kohathi, na Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa Wagershoni; Ladani, na Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Ladani; Yehieli mkuu wao, na Zethamu, na Yoeli, watu watatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Shimei; Shelomothi, na Hazieli, na Harani, watatu. Hao walikuwa vichwa vya koo za baba za Ladani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wana wa Shimei; Yahathi, na Zina, na Yeushi, na Beria. Hao wanne walikuwa wana wa Shimei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yahathi alikuwa mkubwa wao, na Zina alikuwa wa pili; lakini Yeushi na Beria hawakuwa na wana wengi; basi wakahesabiwa pamoja kama ukoo mmoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
